From 8bdfb8aded82de2cba57038eaeaa9c63a025dd27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 77450danik <dnsystems@email.ua>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 11:37:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] winewayland.drv: Read the monitors and set their modes
 through dwm.exe.

arctic_display_v1 carries what wl_output has no place for: the graphics
adapter, the EDID of every monitor, and a configuration of modes and
positions that dwm.exe puts on the hardware. ChangeDisplaySettingsEx now
reaches the screen instead of being emulated in win32u.
